WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
You are not going to ascend&nbsp;
in any organization

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.112
without a sponsor.

00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:06.399
This person

00:00:06.399 --> 00:00:09.222
who is going to&nbsp;pound the 
table on your behalf,

00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:11.808
this is a sponsor.

00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:15.801
It is the critical relationship&nbsp;in your career.

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:17.238
Now, I'm asked all the time,

00:00:18.345 --> 00:00:19.903
"How do you get one?"

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:22.598
Every time you deliver&nbsp;
upon an assignment

00:00:22.598 --> 00:00:24.537
above people's expectations,

00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:26.738
you generate performance currency.

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:30.317
Strong&nbsp;performance currency
 raises your level of visibility

00:00:30.317 --> 00:00:31.522
in the environment,

00:00:31.522 --> 00:00:34.640
such that a sponsor may 
be attracted to you.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.878
So it is important that you 
invest the time&nbsp;to connect,

00:00:38.878 --> 00:00:42.172
to engage and to get to
 know the people that are

00:00:42.172 --> 00:00:43.301
in your environment,

00:00:43.301 --> 00:00:46.468
and&nbsp;more importantly to 
give them the opportunity

00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:47.502
to know you.

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:49.461
Because once they know you,

00:00:49.461 --> 00:00:52.857
there's a higher probability that 
when you approach them

00:00:52.857 --> 00:00:55.215
to ask them to be your sponsor,

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:57.534
they will in fact answer

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:58.683
in the affirmative.

